Note on the source material
---------------------------
The coastline, roads, areas and place names are traced from the map of Leonida
that Rockstar Games released at https://www.rockstargames.com/VI/media.
That map is © Rockstar Games. This tracing is an unofficial, non-commercial fan
work. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Rockstar Games or Take-Two
Interactive, and it will be taken down on request from the rights holder.
Grand Theft Auto and related marks are trademarks of Take-Two Interactive.

The CC BY-NC-SA licence applies only to what contributors added (the vector
tracing and community notes). It grants no rights in Rockstar's map, names or
other material, and no commercial use is allowed.
